    "PR description: 'The orphanage can abort when more than 3,000 peers have orphan announcements. The -maxconnections setting currently has no explicit upper bound.'",
    "Commit message: 'Limit the configurable automatic peer count to 2000, leaving headroom below the default orphanage latency limit.'"
